#     differs: glyph 2 [0x0007 gid 1 (0, 0)] [0x0007 gid 1 (0, -128)] with instructions
#   font 11 `c_noround`, 844 bytes: glyph 2's second component at offset (0, -128) WITHOUT ROUND_XY_TO_GRID:
#   the scaled offset -96 is applied as it is
#     prep: RTG
#     differs: glyph 2 [0x0007 gid 1 (0, 0)] [0x0003 gid 1 (0, -128)] with instructions
#   font 12 `c_scaled`, 852 bytes: glyph 2's second component under a 2x2 of 0.5 (WE_HAVE_A_2X2, diagonal)
#   with SCALED_COMPONENT_OFFSET: the offset (400, 200) is scaled by the matrix before the size
#     prep: RTG
#     differs: glyph 2 [0x0007 gid 1 (0, 0)] [0x0887 gid 1 (400, 200) 2x2 8192/0/0/8192] with instructions
#   font 13 `c_unscaled`, 852 bytes: the same 2x2 of 0.5 with UNSCALED_COMPONENT_OFFSET: the offset (400, 200)
