#     prep: RTG
#     differs: glyph 2 [0x0007 gid 1 (0, 0)] [0x1087 gid 1 (400, 200) 2x2 8192/0/0/8192] with instructions
#   font 14 `c_neither`, 852 bytes: the same 2x2 of 0.5 with NEITHER offset flag: what the host build's
